                                "sense_id": "8d36c955-c1c4-36c6-90eb-e8df8b3b03b7",
                                "text": "Gilbert wandered through . . .the haunts of ravenous dogs and homeless cats that kept themselves alive on the choice pickings of the city's garbage."
